{%- comment -%}
  Dr. Chris POV — "My dad smoked for 40 years" advertorial
  Template: page.dr-chris-landing-page-v1
  Use ?product=bundle in the URL to show the Quit Smoking Bundle variant.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
/* Hide the theme's global header and footer for this landing page only.
   Both wrappers are defined in layout/theme.liquid. */
.header-content,
.footer-content {
  display: none !important;
}

/* ========================================================================
   Grandpa Jackson advertorial v2 — simple, photo-heavy, sans-serif only.
   All tokens from /bb-tokens.css. No serif fonts, no complex chrome.
   ======================================================================== */

/* =====================================================================
   Betterbrand — Colors & Type
   The foundational visual layer. Import this anywhere you need
   brand-correct color, type, spacing and radii.
   ===================================================================== */

/* ---- Webfonts (Google Fonts) ----------------------------------------
   NOTE: Betterbrand's live Shopify theme ("Super Theme BV") likely uses
   licensed display & body fonts we don't have. The choices below are
   close substitutes based on the wordmark and label typography:
     - Antonio  → narrow geometric display, mirrors the BETTERBRAND
       wordmark and product-label headlines (BETTER LUNGS, MULLEIN).
     - Caveat   → casual script for hand-lettered accents that appear
       on labels ("Lung Cleanse and Support") and in editorial headers.
     - DM Sans  → calm modern grotesque body face.
   Replace these with the official brand fonts when available.
-----------------------------------------------------------------------*/
